<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_range_8hpp">glm/gtx/range.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Defines begin and end for vectors and matrices. Useful for range-based for loop. The range is defined over the elements, not over columns or rows (e.g. mat4 has 16 elements).</para>
</section>
